<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan refrains from regular operation.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan refrains from regular operation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) refrained from its regular money market operation at 0020 GMT on Wednesday, money traders said.</p>
